## Independent Benchmarks and Reviews

### ARC-AGI Benchmarks
**Source:** ARC Prize Foundation
**Snapshot:** February 2026

- ARC-AGI-2: 77.1% (verified, more than double Gemini 3 Pro's 31.1%)
- ARC-AGI-2 (Gemini 3 Pro): 31.1% (verified, Deep Think mode)

Gemini 3.1 Pro achieves 77.1% on ARC-AGI-2, more than doubling its reasoning performance compared to Gemini 3 Pro. This is the largest lead any model has held on ARC-AGI-2 across competitors. The benchmark evaluates a model's ability to solve entirely new logic patterns.

### GPQA Benchmarks
**Source:** Google DeepMind Model Card
**Snapshot:** February 2026

- GPQA Diamond: 94.3% (verified)
- GPQA: 88.7% (verified)

Gemini 3.1 Pro significantly outperforms Gemini 3 Pro across these reasoning benchmarks.

