### Third-Party Comparisons
**Source:** Serenities AI, BenchLM, DataCamp, MindStudio, CloudZero, ActivePieces
**Snapshot:** February-October 2026

Multiple independent sources provide comparative analysis:
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs Gemini 3 Pro: ".1" version more than doubles reasoning performance on ARC-AGI-2 (77.1% vs 31.1%)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs Claude Opus 4.6: Leads on 13 of 16 benchmarks, including ARC-AGI-2 (77.1% vs 68.8%)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs GPT-5.2: Leads on most benchmarks, including ARC-AGI-2 (77.1% vs 52.9%)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs Claude Sonnet 4.6: Leads on ARC-AGI-2 (77.1% vs 58.3%)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs GPT-5.3-Codex: Leads on SWE-bench Verified (80.6% vs 56.8%)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs GPT-5.2: Leads on BrowseComp (85.9% vs 65.8%) and LiveCodeBench Pro (2439 vs 2399 Elo)
- Gemini 3.1 Pro vs Gemini 3.8 Flash: Slightly better performance but significantly more expensive

